り直しロマンス！</p>\n<hr>\n<p>“I was wrong about the person I should have cherished most&#8230;” Princess Fiana is betrayed by the man she trusted and seemingly meets a tragic death. But when she awakens in despair, she finds herself back four years in the past. Determined never to repeat the same mistakes, Fiana resolves to change her fate and protect her beloved family and her loyal royal guard, Richard, whom she once lost. Will Richard&#8217;s devoted words finally reach her this time? A romantic tale of a proud princess given a second chance at life!</p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>ー私は、本当に大切にするべき人を間違えた…… 信じていた想い人に裏切られ、非業の死を遂げたはずの王女フィアナ。しかし、絶望の中で目を覚ますと――そこは「4年前」の世界で！？ 二度と同じ過ちは繰り返さない。かつて失ってしまった大切な家族、そして自らの護衛騎士リヒャルトを守るため、フィアナは運命を切り拓くことを決意する。どんな時も隣で厳しく献身的に支えてくれるリヒャルトの声は今度はフィアナに届くのか？ 気高き王女のやり直しロマンス！ “I was wrong about the person I should have cherished most&#8230;” Princess Fiana is betrayed by the man she trusted and seemingly meets a tragic death. But when she awakens in despair, she finds herself back four years in the past. Determined never to repeat the same mistakes, Fiana resolves to [&hellip;]</p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":434883,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"meta":{"_edit_lock":"1794475585:1","_edit_last":"1","_thumbnail_id":"434883","type":"manga","project":"0","alternative_title":"やり直し王女は最愛の騎士のために未来を変えたい～私を殺した元夫なんて願い下げです！～, Yarinaoshi Oujo wa Aisai no Kishi no Tame ni Mirai wo Kaetai, YARINAOSHI OUJO WA SAIAI NO KISHI NO TAME NI MIRAI WO KAETAI: WATASHI WO KOROSHITA MOTO OTTO NANTE NEGAISAGE DESU!","released":"2026","serialization":"","score":"7","views":"2295","background":"","character_image":"","search_index":"Yarinaoshi Oujo wa Aisai no Kishi no Tame ni Mirai wo Kaetai ~Watashi wo Koroshita Moto Otto nante Negaisage desu!~, やり直し王女は最愛の騎士のために未来を変えたい～私を殺した元夫なんて願い下げです！～, Yarinaoshi Oujo wa Aisai no Kishi no Tame ni Mirai wo Kaetai, YARINAOSHI OUJO WA SAIAI NO KISHI NO TAME NI MIRAI WO KAETAI