%92","taxonomy":"artist","_links":{"self":[{"href":"https://rawkuma.net/wp-json/wp/v2/artist/21300","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https://rawkuma.net/wp-json/wp/v2/artist"}],"about":[{"href":"https://rawkuma.net/wp-json/wp/v2/taxonomies/artist"}],"wp:post_type":[{"href":"https://rawkuma.net/wp-json/wp/v2/manga?artist=21300"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https://api.w.org/{rel}","templated":true}]}}]]}},{"id":434875,"date":"2026-11-12T16:27:36","date_gmt":"2026-11-12T09:27:36","guid":{"rendered":"https://rawkuma.net/?post_type=manga&#038;p=434875"},"modified":"2026-11-12T16:32:00","modified_gmt":"2026-11-12T09:32:00","slug":"watashi-no-himitsu-wo-konyakusha-ni-mirareta-toki-no-taishouhou-wo-dareka-oshiete-kudasai","status":"publish","type":"manga","link":"https://rawkuma.net/manga/watashi-no-himitsu-wo-konyakusha-ni-mirareta-toki-no-taishouhou-wo-dareka-oshiete-kudasai/","title":{"rendered":"Watashi no Himitsu wo Konyakusha ni Mirareta Toki no Taishouhou wo Dareka Oshiete Kudasai"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>由緒正しいが貧乏な貴族の令嬢として生まれた私、フェリシア。王家直属騎士団の婚約者にバレないよう身分と顔を隠し、一流冒険者「黒衣のアリシア」として一家を養っているのです。金を稼ぐことを前提に依頼を受け続けた結果、ついた二つ名は「強欲のアリシア」。その通りだけどひどすぎる二つ名に憤慨しつつも金を稼いでいた私ですが、ある日、大口指名依頼にウキウキでギルドにやってきたら、なんと、依頼主は婚約者で!? あの、時間って巻き戻せませんか？</p>\n<hr>\n<p>Felicia is the daughter of a noble but impoverished family. To support her household, she conceals her identity and appearance from her fiancé, a knight serving the royal family, and works as a renowned adventurer known as “Alicia in Black.” Because she always prioritizes earning money when accepting requests, she has earned the nickname “Greedy Alicia.” Though indignant at the harsh nickname, she continues making money. One day, excited to receive a lucrative personal request, she arrives at the guild only to discover that the client is none other than her fiancé! Is there any way to turn back time?</p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>由緒正しいが貧乏な貴族の令嬢として生まれた私、フェリシア。王家直属騎士団の婚約者にバレないよう身分と顔を隠し、一流冒険者「黒衣のアリシア」として一家を養っているのです。金を稼ぐことを前提に依頼を受け続けた結果、ついた二つ名は「強欲のアリシア」。その通りだけどひどすぎる二つ名に憤慨しつつも金を稼いでいた私ですが、ある日、大口指名依頼にウキウキでギルドにやってきたら、なんと、依頼主は婚約者で!? あの、時間って巻き戻せませんか？ Felicia is the daughter of a noble but impoverished family. To support her household, she conceals her identity and appearance from her fiancé, a knight serving the royal family, and works as a renowned adventurer known as “Alicia in Black.” Because she always prioritizes earning money when accepting requests, she has earned the [&hellip;]</p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":434877,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"meta":{"_edit_lock":"1794475519:1","_edit_last":"1","_thumbnail_id":"434877","type":"manga","project":"0","alternative_title":"私の秘密を婚約者に見られた時の対処法を誰か教えてください, Watashi no Himitsu wo Konyakusha ni Mirareta Toki no Taishouhou wo Dareka Oshiete Kudasai, WATASHI NO HIMITSU WO KONYAKU SHA NI MIRARETA TOKI NO TAISHOHOU WO DAREKA OSHIETE KUDASAI","released":"2026","serialization":"","score":"7","views":"2203","background":"","character_image":"","search_index":"Watashi no Himitsu wo Konyakusha ni Mirareta Toki no Taishouhou wo Dareka Oshiete Kudasai, 私の秘密を婚約者に見られた時の対処法を誰か教えてください, Watashi no Himitsu wo Konyakusha ni Mirareta Toki no Taishouhou wo Dareka Oshiete Kudasai, WATASHI NO HIMITSU WO KONYAKU SHA NI MIRARETA TOKI NO TAISHOHOU WO DAREKA OSHIETE KUDASAI","gallery":"a:1:{i:0;i:0;}","daily_visits_timestamp":"1794528000","weekly_visits_timestamp":"1794182400","monthly_visits_timestamp":"1793491200","daily_visits":"379","weekly_visits":"2203","monthly_visits":"2203","readers":"a:1:{i:0;i:945;}","thumbnail":"https://rawkuma.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Watashi-no-Himitsu-wo-Konyakusha-ni-Mirareta-Toki-no-Taishouhou-wo-Dareka-Oshiete-Kudasai.jpg"},"tax":[{"term_id":2,"name":"Action","slug":"action","term_group":0,"term_taxonomy_id":2,"taxonomy":"genre","description":"","parent":0,"count":3035,"filter":"raw"},{"term_id":6,"name":"Fantasy","slug":"fantasy","term_group":0,